@startuml
' Level 3 - One read: "what's my balance?" Where each check happens.
' Render: plantuml-new -tpng 02-read-path.puml
'   1-2 Gateway JWT authorizer: signature, issuer, expiry, client_id. Bad or missing token = 401.
'   3   Interceptor (REQUEST, runs before Cedar): customer = token subject, overwriting the agent's value.
'   4-5 Cedar (ENFORCE, default deny): permit only if the token's scope holds .../read.
'   6-8 Tools Lambda has no table rights. It assumes data-reader with a session policy
'       (LeadingKeys = subject), so DynamoDB can only answer for that customer's partition.
'   Another customer's account id gets {"error": "no such account"}.
hide footbox
skinparam ArrowColor #545B64
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #C9CED6
autonumber

participant "Agent" as A
participant "Gateway" as G
participant "Cedar" as C
participant "Interceptor" as I
participant "Tools Lambda" as T
participant "DynamoDB" as D

A -> G : tools/call + token
G -> G : check JWT
G -> I : request
I --> G : customer = sub
G -> C : allow? (scope)
C --> G : permit
G -> T : tool + customer
T -> D : Query (session role)
D --> T : own rows only
T --> A : result (via gateway)
@enduml
